## Summary

ONNX Runtime's `session.disable_quant_qdq = 1` decodes these models $speedup× faster than its defaults. With the
original int8 exports it also folds the output layer to float twice, once per decoder branch. $name moves that
subgraph in front of the branches, so it is folded once.

